# Input

```scss
a{
keyword-to-keyword:fn( $a:1,

  $b:2
);
keyword-to-positional:fn( $a:1,

  2
);
positional-to-keyword:fn( 1,

  $b:2
);
}

```


# Formatted

```scss
a {
	keyword-to-keyword: fn(
		$a: 1,

		$b: 2
	);
	keyword-to-positional: fn(
		$a: 1,

		2
	);
	positional-to-keyword: fn(1, $b: 2);
}

```
